# Text is LF everywhere, Windows checkouts too: the plugin ships some of it as resources (the agent
# skill, recorded gdb sessions) and tests read it byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout built a plugin
# whose SKILL.md no longer started with "---\n". Windows' own scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
